{{!
    @template mod_edpreset/reorder_modal

    The body of the dialogue shown when a section template is added to a section that already has
    activities in it.

    The left column is the order the section will end up in; the right column holds the activities
    already in the course, for the teacher to drag across. Anything left on the right when they
    confirm is appended below the template, keeping its relative order - so the dialogue can always
    be confirmed without dragging anything.

    Only the course's own activities can be dragged. The template's activities are fixed in the order
    its curator arranged them, and act purely as the positions to drop between.

    Teacher notes are deliberately absent from both lists. A note belongs immediately above the one
    activity it describes, and letting it be dragged away from that activity would only produce
    orphans, so mod_edpreset re-attaches each note when it writes the final order.

    Every item carries data-token, which is what mod_edpreset/reorder reads back: p<presetid> for an
    activity the template will add, c<cmid> for one already in the course. The token, not the column
    an item happens to be sitting in, is what says where it came from.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * uniqid string - supplied by the renderer, makes the two list ids unique
    * templateitems array - token, name, modfullname, icon, istemplate
    * courseitems array - token, name, modfullname, icon, istemplate
    * hascourseitems bool

    Example context (json):
    {
        "uniqid": "abc123",
        "hascourseitems": true,
        "templateitems": [
            {
                "token": "p7",
                "name": "Weekly reading",
                "modfullname": "Book",
                "icon": "<img src='#' alt=''>",
                "istemplate": true
            }
        ],
        "courseitems": [
            {
                "token": "c42",
                "name": "Course introduction",
                "modfullname": "Page",
                "icon": "<img src='#' alt=''>",
                "istemplate": false
            }
        ]
    }
}}
<div class="edpreset-reorder" data-region="reorder">
    <p class="edpreset-reorder-intro">{{#str}} reorder:instructions, mod_edpreset {{/str}}</p>

    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-12 col-md-6 mb-3 mb-md-0">
            <h6 class="edpreset-reorder-heading" id="edpreset-reorder-target-{{uniqid}}">
                {{#str}} reorder:targetheading, mod_edpreset {{/str}}
            </h6>
            <div class="edpreset-reorder-list"
                 data-region="targetlist"
                 aria-labelledby="edpreset-reorder-target-{{uniqid}}"
            >
                {{#templateitems}}
                    {{> mod_edpreset/reorder_item }}
                {{/templateitems}}
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
            <h6 class="edpreset-reorder-heading" id="edpreset-reorder-source-{{uniqid}}">
                {{#str}} reorder:sourceheading, mod_edpreset {{/str}}
            </h6>
            <div class="edpreset-reorder-list"
                 data-region="sourcelist"
                 aria-labelledby="edpreset-reorder-source-{{uniqid}}"
            >
                {{#courseitems}}
                    {{> mod_edpreset/reorder_item }}
                {{/courseitems}}
            </div>
            {{^hascourseitems}}
                <p class="text-muted small">{{#str}} reorder:sourceempty, mod_edpreset {{/str}}</p>
            {{/hascourseitems}}
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
